{"w":2400,"h":3396,"lines":[{"t":"Reading","h":0.016236431045442368,"w":0.083279622395833419,"c":1,"y":0.032310819801233071,"x":0.82676101557399795},{"x":0.071920198806091476,"y":0.078242031552491653,"w":0.76358362833658855,"h":0.021402444378928132,"t":"Yong's book is in many ways a plea for microbial tolerance, pointing out that while fewer","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.069958854258454439,"h":0.018929588219021465,"t":"than one hundred species of bacteria bring disease, many thousands more play a vital role in","y":0.097383721318763383,"w":0.79012344360351561},{"t":"maintaining our health. The book also acknowledges that our attitude towards bacteria is not","c":1,"x":0.069958836956526979,"y":0.11627906962148749,"w":0.79218109130859371,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"c":1,"h":0.019280808834080343,"x":0.069874551189152118,"t":"a simple one. We tend to see the dangers posed by bacteria, yet at the same time we are sold","w":0.78620112101236983,"y":0.13230455584913359},{"h":0.019841127878645115,"w":0.79641510009765637,"c":1,"y":0.14883293054249291,"t":"yoghurts and drinks that supposedly nurture 'friendly' bacteria. In reality, says Yong, bacteria","x":0.069888522494724437},{"y":0.16860465100315503,"c":1,"w":0.80246912638346357,"t":"should not be viewed as either friends or foes, villains or heroes. Instead we should realise we","x":0.069958852356577755,"h":0.017496644818740692},{"c":1,"w":0.73675745646158852,"x":0.069888535630915863,"h":0.020441743875420304,"t":"have a symbiotic relationship, that can be mutually beneficial or mutually destructive.","y":0.18528264408194772},{"t":"What then do these millions of organisms do? The answer is pretty much everything. New","x":0.071949744626677817,"y":0.22080395386140328,"w":0.77174219767252605,"c":1,"h":0.019767208571147554},{"h":0.019913290358544389,"t":"research is now unravelling the ways in which bacteria aid digestion, regulate our immune","x":0.069859000986410541,"y":0.23824789953408843,"c":1,"w":0.77384607950846351},{"c":1,"w":0.77999094645182288,"t":"systems, eliminate toxins, produce vitamins, affect our behaviour and even combat obesity.","y":0.25639553359938505,"x":0.06987267087378532,"h":0.021054504897765725},{"c":1,"w":0.80246912638346357,"t":"ạồỊThey actually help us become who we are, says Yong. But we are facing a growing problem.","x":0.069958852425552137,"y":0.27470930216339251,"h":0.017441860778592999},{"c":1,"x":0.072016467481117175,"t":"Our obsession with hygiene, our overuse of antibiotics and our unhealthy, low-fibre diets are","y":0.29358068333456122,"h":0.017465828445129006,"w":0.79012344360351561},{"t":"disrupting the bacterial balance and may be responsible for soaring rates of allergies and immune","h":0.017667844522968212,"x":0.07201645285631561,"y":0.31095406346569687,"w":0.83127573649088549,"c":1},{"t":"problems, such as inflammatory bowel disease (IBD).","x":0.069958836021965468,"w":0.46502059936523438,"y":0.32979976451593696,"h":0.017667844522968101,"c":1},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.36482558124856146,"c":1,"x":0.072016450155618084,"w":0.79218109130859382,"t":"The most recent research actually turns accepted norms upside down. For example, there are"},{"y":0.38097432033894363,"w":0.77996693929036454,"c":1,"t":"studies indicating that the excessive use of household detergents and antibacterial products","h":0.019135696447078132,"x":0.069894500120445291},{"h":0.017667844522968212,"t":"actually destroys the microbes that normally keep the more dangerous germs at bay. Other studies","c":1,"x":0.069958838558343922,"y":0.39958775025239179,"w":0.83744857788085936},{"w":0.79218109130859371,"t":"show that keeping a dog as a pet gives children early exposure to a diverse range of bacteria,","x":0.072016451135221468,"h":0.017477812840042795,"y":0.41715116260830953,"c":1},{"y":0.43408636368921105,"h":0.020416230560051152,"t":"which may help protect them against allergies later.","w":0.44267781575520826,"c":1,"x":0.071854940474765011},{"h":0.019621906347915052,"t":"The readers of Yong's book must be prepared for a decidedly unglamorous world. Among the less","x":0.071943035645910439,"c":1,"y":0.46976233137002055,"w":0.83348841349283842},{"x":0.072016457382077501,"t":"appealing case studies is one about a fungus that is wiping out entire populations of frogs and","w":0.80041152954101558,"h":0.0175171886933847,"y":0.48837209286355121,"c":1},{"t":"that can be halted by a rare microbial bacterium. Another is about squid that carry luminescent","h":0.018902196760593237,"x":0.072016482707047275,"y":0.50436046531917145,"w":0.81275716145833332,"c":1},{"x":0.0720164689635438,"t":"bacteria that protect them against predators. However, if you can overcome your distaste for some","w":0.83539093017578137,"c":1,"y":0.52470930217961409,"h":0.015988372380376759},{"h":0.017484660423827014,"y":0.54210836298453247,"w":0.81069956461588555,"t":"of the investigations, the reasons for Yong's enthusiasm become clear. The microbial world is a","c":1,"x":0.07201647281333777},{"w":0.80474492390950525,"c":1,"x":0.071900321907545695,"h":0.020984563164772818,"t":"place of wonder. Already, in an attempt to stop mosquitoes spreading dengue fever - a disease","y":0.55832133346371315},{"h":0.018840943124184717,"y":0.57678587390585367,"c":1,"w":0.81081817626953134,"x":0.071959150585684403,"t":"that infects 400 million people a year - mosquitoes are being loaded with a bacterium to block"},{"y":0.59470352112222036,"t":"the disease. In the future, our ability to manipulate microbes means we could construct buildings","h":0.019668566745358107,"w":0.82937703450520828,"c":1,"x":0.071940985855831627},{"x":0.072016470730553117,"c":1,"t":"with useful microbes built into their walls to fight off infections. Just imagine a neonatal hospital","y":0.61189634854941577,"w":0.82921808878580738,"h":0.017464115987537387},{"y":0.63074204920380705,"w":0.79012344360351572,"c":1,"x":0.074074080667377959,"t":"ward coated in a specially mixed cocktail of microbes so that babies get the best start in life.","h":0.01751376490149259},{"y":0.90406976725534172,"c":1,"w":0.030864197413126626,"t":"43","h":0.014534883982160851,"x":0.88477366250742839}]}